# Eastern Plaguelands - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 11 shippable rares and the fixed world
# containers of the Eastern Plaguelands. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is
# not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE
# dropper anywhere in the data is the rare. Ordinary goods and generic
# multi-zone world drops get a note, not a goal. No tame lines ship (the
# data has no tameability flag and no rare here presents beast-drop evidence
# with a core-guide beast-family kill to corroborate - Foulmane's tame
# question is logged in docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are
# unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. Quest-owned containers (the
# Andorhal Watch lockboxes, the Termite Barrel) live in the core guide -
# see docs/eastern-plaguelands-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory. This
# guide never accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/eastern-plaguelands-rares
title Eastern Plaguelands - Rares & Treasures
levels 50-60
zone Eastern Plaguelands
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords eastern plaguelands, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Foulmane - the plague field

  zone map 1422

  goto 46.27,52.43
  kill 1847 optional
  note Level 52 rare ranging the plague field; no sole drop in the data, so there is nothing signature to chase.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Lord Maldazzar - the southern rise

  zone map 1422

  goto 54.16,80.43
  kill 1848 optional
  collect 284065 "Crown of Maldazzar" optional
  note The crown drops only from Maldazzar anywhere in the data; it starts no quest.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

